<title>HONG KONG: Duta Anggada unit sets US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Duta Anggada unit sets US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger UBS Hong Kong.</p>
<p>BORROWER  DUTA ANGGADA INTERNATIONAL BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR PT DUTA ANGGADA REALTY</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$100 MLN   COUPON    6ML+275 BP  MATURITY 3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	    ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCHED WK.24.MAR</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	   CALLS     NONE	  REPLIES  --</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	   REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS   US$250K</p>
<p> RATING   NONE	   SALE LMTS STANDARD    TAX PROV --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF   YES	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY INDONESIA   GOV LAW   ENGLISH     PAY DATE 08.MAY.97</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	    LEAD MANAGERS US$10 MLN  150 BP  ALL-IN 325   BP</p>
<p>	    CO-LEAD MGRS  US$5  MLN  110 BP  ALL-IN 311.6 BP</p>
<p>	    CO-MANAGERS   US$2-3MLN   60 BP  ALL-IN 295   BP</p>
<p>ARRANGER UBS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
